<div class="container">
    <h1>Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam</h1>

    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/A._P._J._Abdul_Kalam.jpg">

    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
        Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam, known as the Missile Man of India, was a great scientist
        and the 11th President of India. He inspired millions with his humble nature,
        vision, and dedication to the nation.
    </p>

    <h2>Achievements</h2>
    <p>
        He played a major role in India's missile and space programs, contributed to ISRO
        and DRDO, and received the Bharat Ratna. His book "Wings of Fire" motivates youth
        to dream big and achieve success.
    </p>
</div>

<footer>
